@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Verificar API
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Raul Silva",
  "email": "raul@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Ver Usuários
GET  {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
